# The story card between acts (81:F10D) run with no button pressed, which
# no other script does (they skip it with START). Passwords entered as
# tools/aladdin/states/02_passwords.box enters them.
# 1. The first password's card (part 1): its text, then load-list command
#    6 (81:F2DA: a fade, and the list goes on to its second text).
# 2. The second's (part 2): 400 frames in, while its text types, a line no
#    text in the game has is put in work RAM at $07E8 (the card's data
#    bank, $80, reads work RAM at $0000-$1FFF; $07E0-$07EF stays 0 and
#    unused through the card) and the text pointer ($50) at it: characters
#    $41, $BA, $B7, $41, then the end code $FD. $BA and $B7 put a mark
#    on the row above (81:F259). The end code goes on to the list's next
#    command, 4 (81:F2AD: the card ends, the level starts).
# 3. The second again, with the part ($035C) poked to 0 after the password
#    has set it and before the card starts: part 0 is shown as part 7
#    (81:F112), whose list is command 8 (81:F2FC: on to the final act's
#    scene at 80:AF42).
load build/aladdin/states/title.state
press DOWN
wait 30
press START
wait 150
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press START
wait 2600
load build/aladdin/states/title.state
press DOWN
wait 30
press START
wait 150
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press START
wait 400
poke $0007E8 41,BA,B7,41,FD
poke $000050 E7,07
wait 1300
load build/aladdin/states/title.state
press DOWN
wait 30
press START
wait 150
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press RIGHT
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press UP
wait 8
press START
wait 60
poke $00035C 00
wait 400
